## Procedure
1. Preserve existing project architecture unless a reviewed change requires otherwise.
2. Keep Reasoning, Control, Effect, and Assurance responsibilities separable even if deployed in one service/process.
3. Consequential effects MUST cross an explicit Effect Boundary after governance evaluation.
